# LIMES — .dockerignore | v1.0.0 | introduced by WP-37
# Keeps the Docker build context to what the images actually need (D-55).
# The compose files themselves and the gold set stay out of the context:
# the worker mounts them at runtime rather than baking them in. Prompt
# files under src/ are .md but must ship with the package, so no global
# *.md rule exists. `reference_questions` is baked into the worker image
# (select_models and evaluate resolve it relative to the ontology path).

.git
venv
.venv
uv.lock-cache

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
htmlcov

tests
docs
gold_set
tools
